  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.6.10 writes HDR gain maps: HeifEncoderOptions.GainMap (HeifGainMapMode None, Preserve, Require) saves the map attached to the image as an ISO 21496-1 tmap item, as iPhones store it, from HEIC or Ultra HDR JPEG; unedited HEIC maps are copied, others encoded at GainMapQuality. Requires PictureSharp 0.8.0. The default output is unchanged. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp.Heif/blob/v0.6.10/docs/releases/release-0.6.10.md",
